      ["Clogged drain pump filter (coins, lint, socks)", "Kinked or blocked drain hose", "Blocked standpipe or house drain", "Unbalanced or overloaded drum", "Lid or door switch not registering", "Failed drain pump"],
      ["Check the display for an error code and look it up in the manual for your model; note it down.", "Pause and let the water out through the small drain hose or by the filter flap with a shallow tray and towels.", "Open the drain pump filter (usually behind a small front panel), clean out coins and lint, and refit it tightly.",
       "Check the drain hose behind the machine for kinks and for a clog; remove it from the standpipe and run water through to test.", "Rebalance the load: remove very heavy items, spread the rest, and avoid washing one heavy item alone.", "Check the door or lid closes fully and the latch is not broken.",
       "Listen: a humming pump that does not move water is jammed or failing; silence can mean no power to the pump."],
      ["Shallow tray and towels", "Flashlight", "Pliers", "Bucket", "Manual or model number"], _MAINS + "Water and electricity do not mix; keep the floor dry and the plug out while the filter is open.",
